    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to present this impressive three-bedroom semi-detached residence to the market. Ideally situated in the mature and highly sought-after residential area of Shanakiel, this superb home offers an exceptional opportunity for those seeking comfort, convenience, and quality. Presented in excellent condition throughout, the property features off-street parking, a fully fitted kitchen, three generously proportioned bedrooms, and a private rear garden with two useful storage sheds.\r\n\r\nPlease see the attached rough architect's hand sketches illustrating a possible dwelling that may be capable of being developed on the substantial site to the side of the property, subject to obtaining the necessary planning permission. These drawings are for illustrative purposes only and should not be construed as planning approval or a guarantee that planning permission will be granted. The sketches are indicative only and are included solely to demonstrate the site's potential.\r\n\r\nConveniently located close to an excellent range of local amenities, including schools, shops, churches, public transport links, and the Apple campus, the property also enjoys easy access to Cork City Centre."
      },
